      "content": "# payments-gateway\n\nNorthBridge payments-gateway handles card authorization, settlement, and refund processing.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `src/gateway/` — service code\n- `config/` — runtime configuration\n- `CHANGELOG.md` — release history\n\n## Releasing\n\nReleases are cut from `main` via a release pull request opened through ReleasePilot. PRs route to the release-reviewer queue for sign-off before the release is tagged.\n"
